function captureTypeLabel(x){return({audio:'Audio',text:'Text',image:'Foto / Bild',screenshot:'Screenshot',link:'Link / Web',handwriting:'Handschrift',mixed:'Gemischt',other:'Capture'})[x.captureType]||'Capture'}
function inboxState(x){if(x.archivedAt)return'archived';if(x.status==='error')return'needs_review';return x.status==='review'?'needs_review':String(x.status||'new')}
function inboxStatusLabel(x){if(x.archivedAt)return'Archiviert';if(x.status==='processing')return x.hasAudio&&!x.transcript?'Whisper / lokale Verarbeitung':'In Verarbeitung';if(x.status==='analyzed')return'Analysiert';if(x.status==='needs_review'||x.status==='review')return'Prüfung nötig';if(x.status==='error')return'Fehler';if(x.status==='done')return'Übernommen';if(x.processingError||x.nextRetryAt)return'Wartet auf lokale Verarbeitung';return'Neu'}
function renderInbox(){const host=$('#ideaInbox'),badge=$('#ideaInboxBadge'),filters=$$('#inboxStatusFilter [data-inbox-filter]');const counts={new:0,processing:0,analyzed:0,needs_review:0,archived:0};for(const x of ideaInbox){const st=inboxState(x);if(counts[st]!==undefined)counts[st]++}filters.forEach(b=>{b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.inboxFilter===inboxFilter);const span=b.querySelector('span');if(span)span.textContent=String(counts[b.dataset.inboxFilter]||0)});const unread=ideaInbox.filter(x=>!x.archivedAt&&!['done','discarded'].includes(String(x.status||'').toLowerCase())).length;if(badge){badge.textContent=String(unread);badge.hidden=unread===0}if(!host)return;const rows=ideaInbox.filter(x=>inboxState(x)===inboxFilter);host.innerHTML=rows.length?rows.map(x=>{const a=x.analysis||{},title=a.suggestedTitle||x.title||captureTypeLabel(x);const badges=[x.transcript?'Transkript ✓':null,(x.status==='analyzed'||x.status==='needs_review')&&a?'Lokale KI ✓':null].filter(Boolean);return `<article class="inbox-card inbox-card-v2" data-inbox-id="${esc(x.id)}"><div class="row">${sourceChip(x.sourceType||'own',captureTypeLabel(x))}<span class="status-chip ${x.status==='processing'?'working':''} ${x.status==='error'?'error':''}">${esc(inboxStatusLabel(x))}</span></div><strong>${esc(title)}</strong><span class="kh-muted">${esc(new Intl.DateTimeFormat('de-AT',{dateStyle:'medium',timeStyle:'short'}).format(new Date(x.receivedAt||x.createdAt)))}</span>${badges.length?`<div class="inbox-mini-flags">${badges.map(v=>`<span>${esc(v)}</span>`).join('')}</div>`:''}</article>`}).join(''):`<div class="kh-empty compact">${inboxFilter==='archived'?'Noch nichts archiviert.':'Keine Captures in diesem Status.'}</div>`;host.querySelectorAll('[data-inbox-id]').forEach(c=>c.onclick=()=>openInbox(c.dataset.inboxId))}
function scheduleIdeaRefresh(){const needs=ideaInbox.some(x=>!x.archivedAt&&['new','processing'].includes(String(x.status||'')));if(needs&&!refreshTimer)refreshTimer=setInterval(()=>{if(!document.hidden)loadIdeaInbox(false).catch(()=>{})},3500);if(!needs&&refreshTimer){clearInterval(refreshTimer);refreshTimer=null}}
function b64bytes(v){const raw=atob(String(v||''));return Uint8Array.from(raw,c=>c.charCodeAt(0))}function bytes64(bytes){let raw='';for(let i=0;i<bytes.length;i+=0x8000)raw+=String.fromCharCode(...bytes.subarray(i,i+0x8000));return btoa(raw)}
async function decryptRelay(ciphertext,secret){let s=String(ciphertext||'').replace(/-/g,'+').replace(/_/g,'/');while(s.length%4)s+='=';const envelope=JSON.parse(new TextDecoder().decode(b64bytes(s))),ss=String(secret||'').replace(/-/g,'+').replace(/_/g,'/');let sp=ss;while(sp.length%4)sp+='=';const key=await crypto.subtle.importKey('raw',b64bytes(sp),'AES-GCM',false,['decrypt']),iv=Uint8Array.from(atob(envelope.iv),c=>c.charCodeAt(0)),ct=Uint8Array.from(atob(envelope.ciphertext),c=>c.charCodeAt(0)),plainbuf=await crypto.subtle.decrypt({name:'AES-GCM',iv},key,ct);return JSON.parse(new TextDecoder().decode(plainbuf))}
