async function thumbnailFromActive(){try{const p=await artifactFor(activeInbox),ph=(p.photos||[])[0];if(!ph)return'';const src=`data:${ph.mime||'image/jpeg'};base64,${ph.dataBase64}`;if(src.length<150000)return src;return await new Promise(resolve=>{const im=new Image();im.onload=()=>{const scale=Math.min(1,600/im.width),c=document.createElement('canvas');c.width=Math.round(im.width*scale);c.height=Math.round(im.height*scale);c.getContext('2d').drawImage(im,0,0,c.width,c.height);resolve(c.toDataURL('image/jpeg',.68).slice(0,175000))};im.onerror=()=>resolve('');im.src=src})}catch(_){return''}}
async function promoteInbox(){
  if(!activeInbox)return;
  const a=activeInbox.analysis||{},
    title=a.suggestedTitle||activeInbox.title||captureTypeLabel(activeInbox),
    body=[activeInbox.transcript,activeInbox.body].filter(Boolean).join('\n\n').trim(),
    sourceType=activeInbox.sourceType||'own',
    sourceUrl=activeInbox.sourceUrl||'',
    content=body?'<p>'+esc(body).replace(/\n\n+/g,'</p><p>').replace(/\n/g,'<br>')+'</p>':'';
  try{
    const saved=await postCloud('/admin/knowledge/save',{
      itemType:'idea',title,contentHtml:content,
      excerpt:(a.summary||body).slice(0,500),
      tags:a.tags||[],
      sources:sourceUrl?[{label:sourceType,url:sourceUrl}]:[]
    }),thumb=await thumbnailFromActive();
    await postCloud('/admin/knowledge/meta',{
      itemId:saved.item.id,kind:'idea',stage:'ideas',
      cluster:(a.topics||[])[0]||'',sourceType,sourceUrl,
      mediaDataUrl:thumb,captureId:activeInbox.captureId
    });
    await vault('/knowledge-idea-inbox/update',{method:'POST',body:{id:activeInbox.id,status:'done'}});
    $('#inboxDialog').close();activeInbox=null;
    await loadWorkspace();
    notice('Capture in den Ideenspeicher übernommen. Das lokale Original bleibt erhalten.');
  }catch(err){notice(err.message,'warn')}
}
function detectSource(url){try{const h=new URL(String(url||'')).hostname.toLowerCase();if(h.includes('reddit.com'))return'reddit';if(h.includes('youtube.com')||h.includes('youtu.be'))return'youtube';if(h)return'web'}catch(_){ }return''}
